{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":56,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܠܪܝܫ ܓܘܕܐ ܕܙܡܪ̈ܐ: ܥܠܔ ܝܵܘܢܲܬ ܐܹܠܸܡ ܪܚܘܿܩܝܼܡ. ܡܸܟ݂ܬܵܡ ܕܕܘܝܕ، ܐܝܡܢ ܕܕܒ݂ܝܩ ܠܗܘܢ ܐܠܗ ܦܠܫܬܝ̈ܐ ܒܓܬ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܪܲܚܸܡ ܥܲܠܝܼ، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ، ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܩܵܡ ܕܵܐܹܫ ܠܝܼ ܒܲܪܢܵܫܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܠܹܗ ܝܵܘܡܵܐ ܦܵܠܫܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܡܲܠܝܘܼܨܝܼ ܝܢܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܵܡ ܕܵܝܫܝܼ ܠܝܼ ܕܸܫ̃ܡܸܢܝܼ̈ ܟܠܹܗ ܝܵܘܡܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܪܵܒܵܐ ܝܢܵܐ ܦܵܠܫܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܥܲܡܝܼ ܒܚܬܝܼܪܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܘܡܵܐ ܕܙܵܕܥܹܢ ܐܵܢܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܝܼܘܼܟ݂ ܒܸܬ ܣܵܒܪܹܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ، ܗ̇ܘ ܕܟܹܐ ܚܵܩܪܹܢ ܗܹܡܸܙܡܵܢܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܣܒܝܼܪܝܼ، ܠܹܐ ܙܵܕܥܹܢ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܘܼܕܝܼ ܡܵܨܹܐ ܥܵܒܹܕ ܒܲܪܢܵܫܵܐ ܐܸܠܝܼ؟","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܠܹܗ ܝܵܘܡܵܐ ܗܹܡܸܙܡܵܢܝܼ̈ ܟܹܐ ܡܲܦܟ̰ܸܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܚܘܼܫܵܒ݂ܵܝ̈ܗ‌ܝ ܒܘܼܬ ܕܝܼܝܼ ܠܒܝܼܫܬܵ‌ܐ ܝܢܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܓ̰ܡܝܼܥ ܠܗܘܿܢ، ܝܬܝܼܒ݂ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܒܟܡܹܐܢܵܐ ܐܵܢܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܢܛܝܼܪܗܘܿܢ ܥܸܩܒܝܼ̈،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܣܦܵܪܵܐ ܕܫܵܩܠܝܼ ܠܓܵܢܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܲܝܬ ܚܠܵܨܵܐ ܐܸܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܡ̣ܢ ܥܸܠܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܥܵܘܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܲܨܠܝܼ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܥܲܡܡܹ̈ܐ ܒܚܸܡܬܵ‌ܐ، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܚܕܵܪ̈ܝܵܬ‌ܝܼ ܡܢܹܐ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܐܲܢ݇ܬ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܲܬܸܒ݂ ܕܸܡܥܝܼ̈ ܒܓܘܼܕܘܼܟ݂.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܵܐ، ܠܹܐ ܝܢܵܐ ܒܟܬܵܒ݂ܘܼܟ݂؟","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗ̇ܝܓܵܗ ܒܸܬ ܕܵܝܪܝܼ ܕܸܫ̃ܡܸܢܝܼ̈ ܠܒܵܬܪܵܐ ܒܝܵܘܡܵܐ ܕܩܵܪܹܝܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܵܗܵܐ ܝܕܝܼܥ ܠܝܼ، ܕܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܩܵܬ‌ܝܼ ܝܠܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ، ܗ̇ܘ ܕܟܹܐ ܚܵܩܪܹܢ ܗܹܡܸܙܡܵܢܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܗ̇ܘ ܕܟܹܐ ܚܵܩܪܹܢ ܗܹܡܸܙܡܵܢܹܗ،","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܣܒܝܼܪܝܼ، ܠܹܐ ܙܵܕܥܹܢ؛","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܘܼܕܝܼ ܡܵܨܹܐ ܥܵܒܹܕ ܒܲܪܢܵܫܵܐ ܐܸܠܝܼ؟","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܵܠܝܼܬ‌ܝܼ ܝܢܵܐ ܢܸܕܪܹ̈ܐ ܕܐܸܠܘܼܟ݂، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܬܲܡܸܡܸܢ ܕܸܒ݂ܚܹ̈ܐ ܕܫܲܟܲܪ̈ܝܵܬܹ‌ܐ ܐܸܠܘܼܟ݂،","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܩܵܡ ܦܲܨܹܝܬ ܠܵܗ̇ ܓܵܢܝܼ ܡ̣ܢ ܡܵܘܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܹܐ، ܐܲܩܠܵܬ‌ܝܼ̈ ܡ̣ܢ ܬܲܪܩܲܠܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܚܵܕܪܹܢ ܩܲܕܡ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܒܲܗܪܵܐ ܕܚܵܝܹ̈ܐ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/56.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/57.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/55.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}